+         `Manpages.install`. `Reason.Environment` (1) significa _it was not possible to get
+         enough information about the install environment_ — falhou uma consulta de caminho, de
+         nome ou de shell; `Reason.Io` (2) significa _an I/O error occurred when trying to write
+         an installation file_.
